        "content": "<p>Growing Wild, at 1201 Highland Avenue in downtown Manhattan Beach, is the premier local florist with a 30-year legacy of creating renowned artistic and innovative fresh and silk arrangements. Their imaginative, evolving designs ensure they remain a Manhattan Beach staple. The talented team prioritizes personal customer connections to design their ideal floral creations.<strong><br/></strong></p><h3>Our three guiding principles:</h3><p><strong>1. Freshness First</strong> – The finest, freshest blooms for lasting beauty and long enjoyment.</p><p><strong>2. Artistry Always</strong> – Innovative designs that transform flowers into living art.</p><p><strong>3. Crafted with Care</strong> – Every arrangement is locally handcrafted with passion, precision, and attentive service.</p>",
